<title>USA: American HomePatient Inc Q4 shr rises.</title>
<headline>American HomePatient Inc Q4 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>BRENTWOOD, Tenn. 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share and percent data)</p>
<p>			     Three Months Ended	 Year Ended</p>
<p>				    Dec. 31,		 Dec. 31,</p>
<p>				   1996    1995	   1996     1995</p>
<p> Revenues		  $ 78,897 $48,837     $268,348 $162,371</p>
<p> Net Income		   4,426   2,350	 15,201    9,089</p>
<p> Earnings per share	  0.30    0.20	   1.10     0.84</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>  outstanding		15,000  11,696	 13,761   10,842</p>
<p>NOTE - Earnings per share and weighted shares outstanding reflect the company's three-for-two stock split effective June 28 and distributed to stockholders on July 12.  Prior year earnings have been adjusted for comparability.</p>
<p>Q4 1995 includes a one-time relocation charge of $700,000. Excluding that charge, per share earnings would have been $0.24.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
